  </p>
  
  <p>
    In between,<br /> 
     there is only smoke.
  </p>

<p>
   Dazwischen ist nur Rauch.
  </p>

  <p>
   (John A. Wheeler, <i>Law without Law</i>,<br />
  in <i>Quantum Theory and Measurement</i>, 1983)
  </p>

